/**
 * The app's exercise library, id to display name and group.
 *
 * Generated from repforge's `src/data/exercises.ts` — do not edit by hand. The
 * app's compact share payload carries only `[id, sets, reps]` for a library
 * movement, so this table is how the shared-routine page recovers the name the
 * message showed. Keys are the ids the app ships, which are the join key against
 * its own library; a movement that is not here arrives with its name inline.
 */
